    {
      "uid": "zhcn:870ed07570b3ca9c516d9bf6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『菊花赏』……\r\n“MISM”……\r\n没能达成目标，令人“失意”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "80ae4999e9e8e5e5a7ab040e75a065c390a6a4c277365176e7601b44bbfaf39d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb879eaeec54d2ae548c206b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "根据今天的表现来看，长距离比赛对她而言仍然\r\n是个过重的负担。\r\n既然这样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0d3ad2728d6a02e05a522a6d1e8e1a65e70cfcde6a81daba22c0b147b9773af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:207919fb92cf68c287d69e3e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在距离已是中距离上限的『日本杯』中，\r\n与古马级的对手们相互竞争，\r\n积累经验比较好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d07ded845ec0b8bf6cb3f968aece491e2d584db226c4e23341ac4cb20bf27bad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
