        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79f3386139a13d8b0d90562c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在经历这一次历练之后，\r\n我感觉我与新宇宙的情谊进一步加深了。\r\n照这个状态的话——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f8a3cc778d901e9af0e16177aca99833d69f73071dec735d24e60fe1a0f9fd9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7f200d532fa5e9a1e44c034",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们一定能一同毫无迷惘地面对“GATE”——\r\n『天皇赏（春）』了吧。\r\n不过到春季天皇赏还有段时间……",
      "source_fingerprint": "46b2e0b0d62179a210f7a8ae51b0050894c459aba6f59e865e0f319518e51106",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
