    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:607a5feca412696f076c0dc6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在距离已是中距离上限的『日本杯』中，\r\n与古马级的对手们相互竞争，\r\n积累经验比较好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d07ded845ec0b8bf6cb3f968aece491e2d584db226c4e23341ac4cb20bf27bad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
